{
  "uid": "overpass-domain",
  "title": "Overpass \u2014 Domain",
  "description": "Whether the system is doing the RIGHT thing, which is the harder and more interesting question than whether it is alive. Requests unfulfilled by reason is the panel this dashboard exists for.",
  "tags": [
    "overpass",
    "domain"
  ],
  "timezone": "utc",
  "editable": true,
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "10s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-1h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "timepicker": {
    "refresh_intervals": [
      "10s",
      "30s",
      "1m",
      "5m",
      "15m"
    ]
  },
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 13,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Allocation outcomes \u2014 the question the system exists to answer",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Requests unfulfilled by reason",
      "description": "The most valuable panel in this system, and the reason the contract made the reason structured data rather than a message string.\n\nA count of losses says the constellation is busy. The reason says WHICH constraint bound, and those have completely different remedies:\n  LOST_TO_HIGHER_VALUE \u2014 contended. Bid more, or widen the window.\n  BLOCKED_BY_SLEW_CONSTRAINT \u2014 the sequence-dependent setup cost bound. More satellites will not help; a wider window might.\n  DUTY_CYCLE_EXHAUSTED \u2014 power-limited. The knapsack dimension bound, not the interval one.\n  NO_OPPORTUNITY_IN_BUCKET \u2014 bookkeeping. Still alive for later buckets.\n  DEADLINE_PASSED / CANCELLED_BY_CUSTOMER \u2014 terminal.\n  SUPERSEDED \u2014 held a slot in a plan a re-plan replaced.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 10,
        "w": 16,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum by (reason_code) (rate(overpass_requests_unfulfilled_total[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{reason_code}}",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 20,
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "normal",
              "group": "A"
            }
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "unit": "ops",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "text",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true,
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Fulfilment ratio",
      "description": "The denominator the panel beside this one needs. A loss count with nothing to divide by cannot distinguish a contended constellation from a merely busy one.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 10,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 1
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum(rate(overpass_requests_fulfilled_total[$__rate_interval])) / clamp_min(sum(rate(overpass_requests_fulfilled_total[$__rate_interval])) + sum(rate(overpass_requests_unfulfilled_total[$__rate_interval])), 1e-9)",
          "legendFormat": "fulfilled",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "text",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Feasibility refusals by reason",
      "description": "The ingress-side sibling of unfulfilled-by-reason. A request refused here never reaches a round and never becomes an unfulfilment, so without this panel the two counts do not reconcile and requests appear to vanish between the services.\n\nTLE_STALE here and a red band on the TLE age panel below are the same event seen from two directions.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 11
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum by (reason) (rate(overpass_feasibility_refusals_total[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{reason}}",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 20,
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "normal",
              "group": "A"
            }
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "unit": "ops",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "text",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true,
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
